<view class="page wel">
  <nav-bar title="福利详情" background="transparent"></nav-bar>
  <view class="card {{item.theme}}" wx:for="{{cards}}" wx:key="id">
    <view class="row1">
      <text>{{item.name}}</text>
      <text class="face" wx:if="{{item.theme==='purple'}}">面值{{item.face}}.00福豆</text>
    </view>
    <view class="bal">{{item.balance}}.00</view>
    <view class="sub">可用余额(福豆)</view>
    <view class="row2">
      <view>
        <view>卡　号：{{item.no}} <text class="copy" catchtap="copyNo" data-no="{{item.no}}">❐</text></view>
        <view>有效期至：{{item.expire}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="cvt" wx:if="{{item.convertible}}" catchtap="convert" data-item="{{item}}">⇄ 转换</view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="rules">
    <view class="rt"><view class="bar"></view>使用规则</view>
    <view class="rb">{{rules}}</view>
  </view>

  <c-modal
    show="{{convertShow}}"
    title="次卡转换"
    cancelText="暂不转换"
    confirmText="确认转换"
    bind:cancel="close"
    bind:close="close"
    bind:confirm="confirm"
  >
    <view>当前次卡可直接用于观影，无需转换。购买商城商品可转换成积分卡，当前可转换{{current.convertPoints}}积分。转换后不支持二次转换！！！</view>
  </c-modal>
</view>
